scroll.wav, select.wav and back.wav are the navigation sounds of the
iconic-es-de theme for ES-DE, by Siddy212:

    https://github.com/Siddy212/iconic-es-de (_inc/sounds)

They are used unchanged. The theme's repository is released under CC0 1.0
Universal (its LICENSE file), and its README asks for attribution under
Creative Commons BY-NC-SA 2.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/2.0/): this note gives it,
and these files are shared under those same terms.
